[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5251345292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5251345292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5251345292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOQErjA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T09:25:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T09:25:34Z","body":"Did you use AI tools when creating this issue report?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5251345292/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5259075675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5259075675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5259075675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOXcgWw","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T21:29:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T21:29:33Z","body":"Unfortunately, this issue is very hard to follow. However, I think it does point to a real problem, but I think it should have a slightly more targeted solution.\n\nRather than putting the `MutexLock` at the top of `_gdvirtual_init_method_ptr()`, I think it would be better inside the `if (_extension->reloadable) { ... }` to only protect the `virtual_method_list` on reloadable extensions\n\nThis way we aren't slowing things down in all cases by locking a mutex when we don't need it. (I think it's unnecessary elsewhere because all threads should end up writing the same value, which I think is fine?)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5259075675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268745477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5268745477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5268745477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOgqtBQ","user":{"login":"UweSchneider","id":39213646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjEzNjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39213646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/UweSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T15:16:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T15:16:08Z","body":"Yes. I wrote the report with AI assistance (Claude) — English is not my first language, and I would not have been able to lay out the details as precisely on my own.\n\nWhat is mine: the crash, the debugging, and the measurements. We hit #120796 in a real project (`godot_voxel` calling `_generate_block()` from a dozen worker threads), the backtrace is from an actual coredump, and the 4-crashes-in-24-launches / 0-in-48 figures were measured on my machine before and after backporting the fix. The tracker race was found while reading the surrounding code during that backport; the reasoning about it is code inspection, and the report says so.\n\nHappy to shorten or restructure it if the length is the problem.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268745477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268747772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5268747772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5268747772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOgq1_A","user":{"login":"UweSchneider","id":39213646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjEzNjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39213646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/UweSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T15:16:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T15:16:20Z","body":"Thanks — and you are right, your version is better than what I proposed.\n\nOnce the resolution is published in one step (as #120796 does it), concurrent callers all store the *same* value into `r_fn_ptr`, and an aligned pointer store is indivisible, so a reader sees either the old or the new value. That race is benign. The only genuine lost update is the linked-list push, because that one is read-modify-write. Scoping the lock to `if (_extension->reloadable)` inside `TOOLS_ENABLED` therefore costs nothing in exported games and nothing for non-reloadable extensions.\n\nI have changed our local 4.6 backport to that form and it is what I would propose for master.\n\nTwo follow-up questions:\n\n1. `clear_internal_extension()` walks and frees the same list. If a reload can overlap with a virtual being resolved on a worker thread, it would need the same lock. Is a reload guaranteed to happen with worker threads stopped?\n2. With the lock only around the push, two threads resolving the *same* method can each register a tracker for the same `void**`. Clearing it twice is harmless, so this is just one extra tracker — but it is a behaviour change worth noting.\n\nAlso: sorry about the length of the original report. I will keep it tighter next time.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268747772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268752856","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5268752856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5268752856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOgrJ2A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T15:16:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T15:17:01Z","body":"Please rewrite the issue report with your own words, we do not accept issue reports written by AI, and please do not write comments using it either","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268752856/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5270323008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5270323008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5270323008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOiK_QA","user":{"login":"UweSchneiderGmbH","id":68603132,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NjAzMTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68603132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH","html_url":"https://github.com/UweSchneiderGmbH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/UweSchneiderGmbH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T17:41:57Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T17:41:57Z","body":"Ok, I'll try it with my own words in english.\n\nThe function Object::_gdvirtual_init_method_ptr can be called simultaniously from multiple threads and when the new created VirtualMethodTracker is inserted in the linked list via tracker->next = virtual_method_list; and virtual_method_list = tracker; this two instructions must be potected with a mutex or there could be a race condition.\n\nThe open question if it is allowed to call the function Object::_gdvirtual_init_method_ptr while clear_internal_extension() is called. If so the access of the list in clear_internal_extension() should also be protected.\n\nI don't think this describes the problem better but you asked for it ;-)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5270323008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5270482633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122291#issuecomment-5270482633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122291","id":5270482633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOiUuyQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/ATho